# The voxel island in MagicaVoxel's isometric view: an orthographic camera
# looking along (-1, -1, -1), outlined voxels, valley mist (height fog),
# MagicaVoxel's bounce caps, and shadow rays that cross the water so the
# sunlit sand shows through it.

image_width 800
aspect_ratio 16/9
samples_per_pixel 128
max_depth 16
camera lookfrom 100 100 100 lookat 0 6 0 vup 0 1 0 ortho 60 focus 170
tonemap aces
sun elevation 40 azimuth 200 intensity 4 angle 3
sky atmosphere
material ground lambertian 0.3 0.3 0.3
ground ground
material haze volume 0.9 0.9 0.9 g 0.5
height_fog 0.004 6 haze
bounces diffuse 2 specular 5 scatter 5
transparent_shadows on
vox models/island.vox edges 0.05
